---
import LegalLayout from "../../layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
import { withSiteName } from "../../data/site";

const title = withSiteName("en", "Privacy Policy");
const description = "Privacy explanation for the independent Istano Basa Pagaruyung guide, including minimal data use, third-party services, and user rights.";
---

<LegalLayout
  {title}
  {description}
  lang="en"
  alternateHref="/privacy-policy/"
  eyebrow="PRIVACY POLICY"
  heading="Minimum data, open explanation."
  lead="This page explains what data may be processed when you access the site, why it is used, and how Cookie choices are stored locally on your device."
>
  <section>
    <h2>Scope of data</h2>
    <p>We aim to limit data processing to what is genuinely needed to operate the site. This includes basic technical data from web requests, the Cookie preferences you choose to store on your device, and information you voluntarily send through any communication channels that may be available.</p>
    <p>The site is not designed to build commercial behavioural profiles. We do not sell personal data, do not build marketing segmentation, and do not use third-party advertising trackers.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Use of third-party services</h2>
    <p>Some elements of the site may rely on third-party services only where relevant to a page function. An embedded Google Maps map is used to help with location orientation. Google Analytics loads only if you grant analytics consent through the Cookie Settings page.</p>
    <p>If analytics consent is not given, the analytics script will not load. That choice is stored locally in your browser so it can be reapplied when you open another page on the site.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>User rights and control</h2>
    <p>You can review and change your Cookie preferences at any time via the Cookie Settings page. For data that may relate to direct communication, you may request access, correction, or deletion where applicable under the relevant regulations.</p>
    <p>We suggest you also review the privacy policies of the third-party services used in a limited way on this site, especially if you interact with the map service or enable analytics.</p>
  </section>
</LegalLayout>
